imal).</li>\n<li><em>Low-light vision</em>.</li>\n<li>Alignment: Always neutral.</li>\n<li>Treasure: None.</li>\n<li>Proficient with its natural weapons only. A non-combative herbivore treats its natural weapons as secondary attacks. Such attacks are made with a –5 penalty on the creature’s attack rolls, and the animal receives only 1/2 its <em>Strength</em> modifier as a damage adjustment.</li>\n<li>Proficient with no armor unless trained for war. (See <em>FAQ</em>s and <em>Handle Animal Skill</em>.)</li>\n<li>Animals breathe, eat, and sleep.</li>\n</ul>","instructions":""},"tags":[],"changes":[],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"classAssociations":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"animal","armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"subType":"racial","level":2,"hd":8,"hp":9,"bab":"med","skillsPerLevel":2,"savingThrows":{"fort":{"value":"high"},"ref":{"value":"high"},"will":{"value":"low"}},"fc":{"hp":{"value":0},"skill":{"value":0},"alt":{"value":0,"notes":""}},"wealth":"","alignment":"","classSkills":{"acr":true,"clm":true,"fly":true,"per":true,"ste":true,"swm":true}},"type":"class","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":112500,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.pf1.racial-hd.Item.WJqmmfXscPVpcISH"}},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"_id":"Vs9luKKqUBWg8LlN","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795124813470,"modifiedTime":1795124816206,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"img":"systems/pf1/icons/feats/lighting-reflexes.jpg","name":"Lightning Reflexes","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>You have faster reflexes than normal.</em></p><p><strong>Benefits</strong>: You get a +2 bonus on all Reflex saving throws.</p>","instructions":""},"tags":["General","Saving Throw"],"actions":[],"attackNotes":[],"effectNotes":[],"uses":{"value":null,"per":"","autoDeductChargesCost":"","maxFormula":"","rechargeFormula":""},"changes":[{"_id":"c0dTOYt2","formula":"2","target":"ref","type":"untyped","operator":"add","priority":0}],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"charges":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"","armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"subType":"feat","traitType":"","traitCategory":"","racePoints":null,"abilityType":"na","associations":{"classes":[]},"showInQuickbar":false,"crOffset":"","inherited":false,"acquired":false,"simple":false,"summons":false,"disabled":false,"classSkills":{},"sources":[{"id":"PZO1110","pages":"115, 130"}]},"type":"feat","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":212500,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.pf1.feats.Item.0bZf3SDkvVOe2ujH"},"pf1":{"migration":"11.11"}},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"name":"tongue","type":"attack","system":{"description":{"value":"sbc | Placeholder for Special Attacks, which in most statblocks are listed under 'Special Attacks' in the statistics block, but are described in the 'Special Abilities' block. Remove duplicates as needed!","instructions":""},"tags":[],"actions":[],"attackNotes":[],"effectNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"charges":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"","flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"uses":{"value":null,"per":"","autoDeductChargesCost":"","maxFormula":"","rechargeFormula":""},"scriptCalls":[],"masterwork":false,"enh":null,"proficient":false,"held":"1h","ammo":{"type":"","capacity":null,"misfire":null,"explode":null},"subType":"misc","baseTypes":[],"broken":false,"weaponGroups":[],"showInQuickbar":true,"size":"med"},"img":"systems/pf1/icons/skills/yellow_36.jpg","_id":"EgY7w3hCIDyzZbYS","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":212500,"flags":{"pf1":{"migration":"11.11"}},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795124813767,"modifiedTime":1795124816206,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"_id":"AKgLQoS65KVSPH8l","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795124813944,"modifiedTime":1795124816206,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"img":"icons/commodities/biological/tentacle-purple-white.webp","name":"Pull (Tongue, 5 Feet)","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>A creature with this ability can choose to attempt a free combat maneuver check with a successful attack. If successful, this check pulls a creature closer. The distance pulled is set by this ability. The type of attack that causes the pull and the distance pulled are included in the creature’s description. This ability works only on creatures of a size equal to or smaller than the pulling creature. Creatures pulled in this way do not provoke attacks of opportunity and stop if the pull would move them into a solid object or creature.</p><p><em>Format</em>: pull (tentacle, 5 feet)</p><p><em>Location</em>: Special Attacks and individual attacks.</p><p><em>Usage:</em> Replace range.</p>","instructions":""},"tags":["Universal Monster Rules"],"actions":[],"attackNotes":[],"effectNotes":[],"uses":{"value":null,"per":"","autoDeductChargesCost":"","maxFormula":"","rechargeFormula":""},"changes":[],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"charges":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"","armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"subType":"misc","traitType":"","traitCategory":"","racePoints":null,"abilityType":"ex","associations":{"classes":[]},"showInQuickbar":false,"crOffset":"","inherited":false,"acquired":false,"simple":false,"summons":false,"disabled":false,"classSkills":{}},"type":"feat","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":412500,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.pf-content.pf-universal-monster-rules.Item.mpBvgTQGi0KX13tF"},"pf1":{"migration":"11.11"}},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"_id":"ixOvY0UxqUnIU3SI","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795124814693,"modifiedTime":1795124816206,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"img":"systems/pf1/icons/skills/red_22.jpg","name":"Swallow Whole (1d4 Bludgeoning Damage, AC 10, 1 Hp)","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>If a creature with this special attack begins its turn with an opponent <a>grappled</a> in its mouth (see <a href=\"https://www.aonprd.com/UMR.aspx?ItemName=Grab\">grab</a>), it can attempt a new combat maneuver check (as though attempting to pin the opponent). If it succeeds, it swallows its prey, and the opponent takes bite damage. Unless otherwise noted, the opponent must be at least one size category smaller than the swallowing creature. Being swallowed causes a creature to take damage each round. The amount and type of damage vary and are given in the creature’s statistics. A swallowed creature keeps the <a>grappled</a> condition, while the creature that did the swallowing does not. A swallowed creature can try to cut its way free with any light slashing or piercing weapon (the amount of damage required for the creature to cut itself free is equal to 1/10 the creature’s total hit points), or it can just try to escape the grapple. The Armor Class of the interior of a creature that swallows whole is normally 10 + 1/2 its natural armor bonus, with no modifiers for size or Dexterity. If a swallowed creature cuts its way out, the swallowing creature cannot use swallow whole again until the damage is healed. If the swallowed creature escapes the grapple, it ends up back in the attacker’s mouth, where it may be bitten or swallowed again.</p><p><em>Format</em>: swallow whole (5d6 acid damage, AC 15, 18 hp);</p><p><em>Location</em>: Special Attacks.</p><p><em>Usage: </em>Replace damage</p>","instructions":""},"tags":["Universal Monster Rules"],"actions":[{"_id":"t2e77zott5oor4i0","actionType":"mcman","activation":{"type":"standard","unchained":{"cost":2,"type":"action"},"cost":1},"damage":{"parts":[{"formula":"1d4"}]},"img":"systems/pf1/icons/skills/red_22.jpg","name":"Use","tag":"swallowWholeEx","uses":{},"ability":{"critRange":20,"critMult":2},"powerAttack":{"damageBonus":2,"critMultiplier":1},"notes":{"effect":[""]}}],"attackNotes":[],"effectNotes":[],"uses":{"value":null,"per":"","autoDeductChargesCost":"","maxFormula":"","rechargeFormula":""},"changes":[],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"charges":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"","armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"subType":"misc","traitType":"","traitCategory":"","racePoints":null,"abilityType":"ex","associations":{"classes":[]},"showInQuickbar":false,"crOffset":"","inherited":false,"acquired":false,"simple":false,"summons":false,"disabled":false,"classSkills":{}},"type":"feat","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":512500,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.pf-content.pf-universal-monster-rules.Item.cJ8ApelhYihzGh9t"},"pf1":{"migration":"11.11"}},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"_id":"7FeE2dx6GGkxewLW","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795124814838,"modifiedTime":1795124816206,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"folder":"xPJd6syoxDiunnzG","img":"systems/pf1/icons/skills/red_29.jpg","name":"Bite","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>A primary natural weapon that crushes, punctures and tears with teeth and jaws.</p><p>It deals bludgeoning, slashing or piercing damage, whichever is most beneficial one.</p><hr /><p>For general rules on natural attacks, see: @UUID[Compendium.pf1.pf1e-rules.nBnUY0koBzXqoEft.JournalEntryPage.8zivKFrhTVkbtjm3]{Natural Attacks} (UMR).</p>","instructions":""},"tags":[],"actions":[{"_id":"jxtofrfc2lcw0osl","ability":{"attack":"str","damage":"str","damageMult":1,"critRange":20,"critMult":2},"actionType":"mwak","activation":{"type":"attack","unchained":{"type":"attack","cost":1},"cost":1},"damage":{"parts":[{"formula":"sizeRoll(1, 6, @size)","types":["piercing","bludgeoning","slashing"]}]},"img":"systems/pf1/icons/skills/red_29.jpg","name":"Attack","range":{"units":"melee"},"tag":"bite","uses":{},"powerAttack":{"damageBonus":2,"critMultiplier":1},"extraAttacks":{"type":"custom","formula":{}},"naturalAttack":{"primary":true,"secondary":{"attackBonus":"-5","damageMult":1}}}],"attackNotes":[],"effectNotes":["plus grab"],"links":{"children":[],"charges":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"","flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"uses":{"value":null,"per":"","autoDeductChargesCost":"","maxFormula":"","rechargeFormula":""},"scriptCalls":[],"masterwork":false,"enh":0,"proficient":true,"held":"1h","ammo":{"type":"","capacity":null,"misfire":null,"explode":null},"subType":"natural","baseTypes":["Bite"],"broken":false,"weaponGroups":["natural"],"showInQuickbar":true,"size":"med","material":{"base":{"value":"steel"},"normal":{"value":null},"addon":[]},"class":null},"type":"attack","effects":[],"sort":112500,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.pf1.monster-abilities.Item.szjeStouwI3F3WdP"},"pf1":{"migration":"11.11"}},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"name":"Ecology","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<div><strong>Environment</strong>:   temperate or warm marshes and aquatic </